  "body": "Step into the comfort and ease of modern living with this beautifully presented four-bedroom, two-bathroom home, perfectly positioned in the highly desirable Half Moon Bay community.\r\n\r\nExperience the Advantages of This Exceptional Residence:\r\n\r\n- Generous Four Bedrooms: Plenty of space for families, guests, or a dedicated home office—tailored to suit your lifestyle.\r\n- Two Stylish Bathrooms: Thoughtfully designed for privacy and effortless daily routines, making mornings seamless for everyone.\r\n- Secure Internal-Access Garage: Enjoy the convenience and peace of mind that comes with private, covered parking for your vehicle.\r\n- Light-Filled Open-Plan Living: Relax or entertain in spacious living and dining areas bathed in natural light—perfect for hosting friends or enjoying quiet evenings at home.\r\n- Contemporary Kitchen: Cook with confidence using quality appliances, ample bench space, and abundant storage—making meal preparation a pleasure.\r\n- Low-Maintenance Outdoor Spaces: Ideal for alfresco dining, weekend BBQs, or simply unwinding in your own private retreat.\r\n\r\nA Location That Complements Your Lifestyle\r\n\r\nNestled in a welcoming neighbourhood, you'll benefit from easy access to local schools, beautiful parks, shopping centres, and convenient public transport options—streamlining your daily routine and connecting you to everything you need.\r\n\r\nPlease note: CCC (Code Compliance Certificate) & Title are currently awaited.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss the opportunity to secure a polished, modern home in one of Auckland’s most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing and experience the exceptional lifestyle that awaits you in Half Moon Bay.",
